  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Look at your scabbard, now look at me, now back at your scabbard, now back to me, what’s this? Why yes it’s your sword, when did I take it? That’s a good question.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Combat Expertise, Improved steal, Sleight of Hand 4 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the phantom thieves thieves acumen class feature, using your ranks in Sleight of Hand as your phantom thief level.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> A rogue may take this feat in place of a rogue talent, provided he meets the prerequisites.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc48\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
